{"translator":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）","rows":[{"id":"user-5","name":"クラスメイトたち","text":"ねぇ……！\r\n翼くん来てるよ","trans":"喂……！\n翼来了哦","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-8","name":"off","text":"また誰かが\r\n俺を呼んでる","trans":"又有谁在\n叫我了","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-12","name":"クラスメイト１","text":"あの、翼くん……\r\nよかったら、うちらと一緒に────","trans":"那个，翼……\n如果可以的话，要不要和我们一起————","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-15","name":"off","text":"悪い気はしない\r\n贅沢な悩みだとも思う","trans":"感觉并不坏\n我也觉得这是奢侈的烦恼","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-18","name":"クラスメイト２","text":"……翼くんはやめときなって","trans":"……翼就算了吧","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-19","name":"クラスメイト１","text":"なんで？\r\n私だって翼くんと…………","trans":"为什么？\n我也想和翼…………","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-22","name":"off","text":"…………それでも\r\n俺にはやらなきゃいけないことがある","trans":"…………即便如此\n我也有非做不可的事","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-25","name":"クラスメイト２","text":"ほら、幼馴染の────","trans":"你看，他的青梅竹马————","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-28","name":"off","text":"今日こそ俺は……──────","trans":"今天我一定……——————","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008018010010","name":"霧子","text":"翼くん！","trans":"翼！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-37","name":"翼","text":"…………霧子……","trans":"…………雾子……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008018010030","name":"霧子","text":"ほら、お弁当……！\r\n一緒に食べよ","trans":"你看，便当……！\n一起吃吧","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-41","name":"off","text":"…………\r\nこの笑顔に何度もやられてきた","trans":"…………\n我不知被这个笑容打败过多少次","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-44","name":"翼","text":"────た、食べない","trans":"————不、不吃","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008018010040","name":"霧子","text":"…………へ？","trans":"…………诶？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-48","name":"off","text":"今日の俺は、ひと味違う","trans":"今天的我与平时不同","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-51","name":"翼","text":"だから…………\r\n食べないって","trans":"所以说…………\n我说了不吃","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008018010050","name":"霧子","text":"どうしたの？\r\n手作りだよ……？","trans":"怎么了？\n是我亲手做的哦……？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-53","name":"翼","text":"────……決めたんだ\r\n霧子から弁当は…………もう────","trans":"————……我已经决定了\n雾子给的便当…………以后————","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008018010060","name":"霧子","text":"あーん","trans":"来，啊——","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008018010070","name":"霧子","text":"美味しいでしょ？","trans":"很好吃吧？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008018010080","name":"霧子","text":"よかった\r\nいつもの翼くんだ","trans":"太好了\n是平常的翼","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-66","name":"off","text":"────……っ\r\n体が……勝手に……","trans":"————……唔\n身体……自己就……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-67","name":"off","text":"────なんなんだ\r\n……この体は…………！","trans":"————怎么回事啊\n……这个身体…………！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-72","name":"翼","text":"うわぁぁぁぁぁぁ……！","trans":"呜哇啊啊啊啊啊啊……！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008018010100","name":"霧子","text":"…………！\r\n翼くん……？","trans":"…………！\n翼……？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-81","name":"翼","text":"────はぁはぁ……！","trans":"————哈啊哈啊……！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-85","name":"翼","text":"…………\r\nここなら誰も────","trans":"…………\n这里的话谁都不会————","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008018010110","name":"ルカ","text":"誰……？\r\n勝手に、ここに────","trans":"谁……？\n擅自就进来这里————","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-94","name":"翼","text":"あの……！\r\nルカ先輩がいるって知らなくて……","trans":"那个……！\n我不知道路加前辈在这里……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008018010120","name":"ルカ","text":"…………なんだ、キミか","trans":"…………什么啊，是你啊","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008018010130","name":"ルカ","text":"何やってんの、こんなとこで","trans":"在这种地方干什么呢","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-98","name":"翼","text":"あ、その……────","trans":"啊，那个……————","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008018010140","name":"ルカ","text":"そういうのは先に言いな","trans":"那种事要早点说啊","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008018010150","name":"ルカ","text":"……ん\r\n半分やる","trans":"……嗯\n分你一半","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-105","name":"翼","text":"あの、先輩…………","trans":"那个，前辈…………","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-111","name":"off","text":"────いや、決めたんだ","trans":"————不，我已经决定了","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008018010170","name":"ルカ","text":"ていうか、今日のキミ\r\nなんか大人しくないか……？","trans":"话说，今天的你\n怎么感觉有点乖啊……？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-117","name":"off","text":"今日こそ\r\n終わらせるんだって────","trans":"今天一定要\n做个了断————","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-121","name":"翼","text":"すみません、先輩────！","trans":"对不起，前辈————！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008018010190","name":"？？？","text":"きゃっ！？","trans":"呀！？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-125","name":"翼","text":"……！\r\nご、ごめんなさい！","trans":"……！\n对、对不起！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-128","name":"翼","text":"……冬優子！？","trans":"……冬优子！？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008018010210","name":"冬優子","text":"お兄ちゃん……！\r\nよかった、やっと見つかった","trans":"哥哥……！\n太好了，终于找到你了","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008018010220","name":"冬優子","text":"はい、お弁当\r\nうちに忘れていったでしょ？","trans":"给你，便当\n你忘在我家了吧？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-131","name":"翼","text":"あっ……\r\n────いや…………","trans":"啊……\n————不…………","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008018010230","name":"冬優子","text":"どうしたの？\r\nお昼、一緒に食べよ","trans":"怎么了？\n午饭一起吃吧","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008018010240","name":"ルカ","text":"私と食べるんだよな\r\n翼","trans":"你要和我一起吃吧\n翼","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008018010250","name":"冬優子＆翼","text":"え？","trans":"诶？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008018010260","name":"ルカ","text":"そうだろ？\r\nだからここに来たんだよな","trans":"对吧？\n所以才会来这里嘛","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008018010270","name":"冬優子","text":"……そうなの？\r\nお兄ちゃん","trans":"……是这样吗？\n哥哥","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008018010280","name":"霧子","text":"翼くん、いた……！","trans":"翼，找到了……！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008018010290","name":"霧子","text":"もー、探したよ～\r\n屋上で食べたいなら、そう言ってくれれば────","trans":"真是的，我找了好久～\n想在屋顶吃的话，早说一声就好————","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-156","name":"翼","text":"あ、あの……\r\nみなさん…………","trans":"那、那个……\n各位…………","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008018010300","name":"霧子","text":"ね、翼くん\r\n誰のお弁当が一番か、わかってるよね？","trans":"呐，翼\n你知道谁的便当最好吃吧？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008018010310","name":"ルカ","text":"愚問だな\r\n……私のだろ？","trans":"真是愚蠢的问题\n……是我的吧？","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008018010320","name":"冬優子","text":"私も、その……\r\n一生懸命作ったから…………","trans":"我也是，那个……\n是拼命做出来的…………","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-175","name":"翼","text":"み、みんな\r\nいったん落ち着いて……────","trans":"各、各位\n先冷静一下……————","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"3008018010321","name":"霧子＆冬優子＆ルカ","text":"…………翼くん！","trans":"…………翼！","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true}],"additionalSources":[{"id":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","package":"enza-player-app-fix.zip","dictionary":"data/translations/zh_dynamic.json","sha256":"63c8feb976e689fa7d5b8d21e48ce143c9f462fdaa8a2d1c3367e9c7fccefd98","credit":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）"}]}